#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:5
msgid "Row"
msgstr "行"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:8
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:10
msgid ""
"A row of `cells`_ from the `title block`_ is a group of `cells`_ that are "
"placed one beside the other."
msgstr ""
"`图框 <cells_>`_ 的 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的一行是一组 `个细胞 <cells_>`_，它们被放在另一边。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block row"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框行"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:18
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:20
msgid ""
"A row from the `title block`_ has only one property, the height of the "
"`cells`_ that are part of the row."
msgstr "从 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的一行只有一个属性，是属于该行的 `细胞的高度 <cells_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:23
msgid "To display the row height:"
msgstr "要显示行高："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:25
msgid "Double click on the row head."
msgstr "双击行头。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:30
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block row height property"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech图框行高度属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/row.rst:34
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works with pixels, the height of the row can only be defined "
"according pixel unit."
msgstr "QElectroTech用像素工作，行的高度只能按照像素单位来定义。"
